--        DB shows prove Kricket is a multi-venue producer. Keep the row as a
--        visible aggregate/trigger for now so existing shows remain visible,
--        and stamp a production_companies row for attribution.
--   556  Coastal Entertainment Productions: existing place_id resolves to an
--        Astoria office, not a venue. Model as production company and keep the
--        hidden source row out of public club browse.
--   573  Big Pine Comedy Festival: no Google Places single-venue hit; current
--        schema intentionally models festivals as clubs.club_type='festival'.
